Other disclosures to Third Parties are generally prohibited unless permitted under the Agreement or with the Disclosing Party’s prior written consent (clauses 6.3 and 11.5). Consultants are not expressly named, but they would likely be covered only if they qualify as “advisers” or other authorized Representatives under clause 6.5.

